      "content": "hey, can you run a deep dive on the Q3 performance reports for the luxury retail clients? i need a full breakdown of where we're hitting our ROAS targets and where we're lagging. i also just uploaded a folder with the latest internal strategy memos and budget spreadsheets from the leadership team so you can factor those into your analysis. let me know what the main takeaways are.",
